        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>High Security Lock Cylinder for Kwikset and Titan Single Cylinder Deadbolts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis high security lock cylinder fits <a href=\"/collections/kwikset-locks\"><b>Kwikset Single Cylinder Deadbolts</b></a> including Kwikset Titian, Kwikset 980, Kwikset 780, and Baldwin Reserve deadbolts with a Kwikset keyway. Does NOT fit door knobs, door levers, double cylinder locks or Kwikset 258 deadbolts. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nHigh security  Mul-T-Lock lock cylinders are designed with pick and drill resistance. Hardened steel inserts are strategically placed in sensitive areas to resist against drilling attempts. Specific parts are reinforced with some of the strongest materials available to resist tampering and forced entry.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSupplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the person allowed to have the keys duplicated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock MTL-206SP-KIDKW Security Lock Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li><b>For Kwikset Single Cylinder Handlesets and Deadbolts</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\"><b>Extra Mul-T-Lock Keys</b></a>  if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
